      "en": "David saw that Saul had come out to seek his life. David was in the wilderness of Ziph in the woods.",
      "ko": "다윗이 사울의 자기 생명을 찾으려고 나온 것을 보았으므로 그가 십황무지 수풀에 있었더니",
      "source_text_hash": "6388a5fd0b312615cc970af5555c6bd6843f8d414f6169cdac87153de3318304",
      "translation_text_hash": "aa6b54229b2317069ea27ee769c774e99135121401649d030299faff5db272e8",
