      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "1SA",
          "chapter": 23,
          "verse": 20
        }
      ],
      "en": "Now therefore, O king, come down. According to all the desire of your soul to come down; and our part will be to deliver him up into the king’s hand.”",
      "ko": "그러하온즉 왕은 내려오시기를 원하시는대로 내려 오소서 그를 왕의 손에 붙일 것이 우리의 의무니이다",
      "source_text_hash": "f71b3cf5b300faa18fd32b75789cc0497a811e5e807358e2e7dfc8d5136084d0",
      "translation_text_hash": "c38c5eff5e7684d387bb911cf7436f8e8dcd3bb70b086a2c712ab9b560e8e63b",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
