      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "1SA",
          "chapter": 23,
          "verse": 22
        }
      ],
      "en": "Please go make yet more sure, and know and see his place where his haunt is, and who has seen him there; for I have been told that he is very cunning.",
      "ko": "혹이 내게 말하기를 그가 심히 공교히 행동한다 하나니 너희는 가서 더 자세히 살펴서 그가 어디 은적하였으며 누가 거기서 그를 보았는지 알아보고",
      "source_text_hash": "268df388c28fc5c659c5443b6a406d3a7a372b909c78cbb912106134125935d4",
      "translation_text_hash": "12e72fed0c3d4efdb66daf766447a87f068994e35a40c740f94efddd579d295e",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
